      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Note that there are only two arrows pointing to $ z_{x} $ and that these come from variables that are uncorrelated (as $ E_{x} $ and $ G_{x} $ are not connected by any paths). The same is true for $ z_{y} $. Thus, by the equation of complete determination,",
